{"id":"07eed3d8724c5f96","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces.md","title":"Example II.6 Sheaves on a Discrete Space","display":"Example II.6 Sheaves on a Discrete Space","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces","aliases":["14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces"],"display":"Example II.6 Sheaves on a Discrete Space","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.6 étale equivalence, printed 90–92; DjVu 51–52; explicit discrete specialization","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example II.6 Sheaves on a Discrete Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6 étale equivalence, printed 90–92; DjVu 51–52; explicit discrete specialization"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau=\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_x)_{x\\in X},(B_x)_{x\\in X}\">\\((A_x)_{x\\in X},(B_x)_{x\\in X}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 中集合族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上任意层。对象值取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq X\">\\(U\\subseteq X\\)</span>，限制公式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\\subseteq X\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\subseteq X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_A,F_B\">\\(F_A,F_B\\)</span> 的限制函数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 包装为集合箭头。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_A(U)=\\prod_{x\\in U}A_x,\\qquad\\rho^U_{F_A,V}(a)=a|_V,\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F_A,X,\\mathcal P(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_A(U)=\\prod_{x\\in U}A_x,\\qquad\\rho^U_{F_A,V}(a)=a|_V,\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F_A,X,\\mathcal P(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(F(U)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\prod_{x\\in U}F(\\{x\\}),\\;s\\longmapsto(s|_{\\{x\\}})_{x\\in U}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(F(U)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\prod_{x\\in U}F(\\{x\\}),\\;s\\longmapsto(s|_{\\{x\\}})_{x\\in U}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F_A,F_B)\\cong\\prod_{x\\in X}B_x^{A_x}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F_A,F_B)\\cong\\prod_{x\\in X}B_x^{A_x}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单点开覆盖两两交为空，空集值为单点，所以任何逐点数据唯一拼接。层态射也完全由单点分量决定，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\\simeq\\prod_{x\\in X}\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\\simeq\\prod_{x\\in X}\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\varnothing\">\\(X=\\varnothing\\)</span>，空积只有一个对象及态射；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 单点，恢复集合范畴。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in\\mathcal U$，$\\tau=\\mathcal P(X)$，$(A_x)_{x\\in X},(B_x)_{x\\in X}$ 为 $\\mathcal U$ 中集合族。$F$ 为 $X$ 上任意层。对象值取 $U\\subseteq X$，限制公式取 $V\\subseteq U\\subseteq X$；$F_A,F_B$ 的限制函数按 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 包装为集合箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau=\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"(A_x)_{x\\in X},(B_x)_{x\\in X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"F_A,F_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}","display":false},{"tex":"F_A(U)=\\prod_{x\\in U}A_x,\\qquad\\rho^U_{F_A,V}(a)=a|_V,\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F_A,X,\\mathcal P(X)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(F(U)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\prod_{x\\in U}F(\\{x\\}),\\;s\\longmapsto(s|_{\\{x\\}})_{x\\in U}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F_A,F_B)\\cong\\prod_{x\\in X}B_x^{A_x}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X)\\simeq\\prod_{x\\in X}\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1863,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces|Example II.6 Sheaves on a Discrete Space]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-ex-sheaves-on-discrete-spaces|Example II.6 Sheaves on a Discrete Space]]"}],"outgoing":["f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","83765a3303e549f5"]}